  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integration and Socio-economic Inclusion of Street Youths 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project focused on improving living conditions of street youth through three key results :- 1.	Promote and support social reintegration of at least 1000 street youths (men and women) 2.	Promote and support economic reintegration of 1000 street youths 3. Reduce the impact of insecurities, socio-economic discrimination and deprivations of 500 street young women and youth living with disabilities</narrative>
  </description>
